  {
   "text": {
    "la": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "In sanctárum vírginum ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N. "
        },
        "et ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N. "
        },
        "commemoratióne te, Dómine, mirábilem prædicántes, múnera votíva deférimus; præsta, quǽsumus, ut, sicut eárum tibi grata sunt mérita, sic nostræ servitútis accépta reddántur offícia. Per Christum."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "pt-BR": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Ó Deus, nós vos trazemos nossas oferendas proclamando as vossas maravilhas na festa de santas ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        " e ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        " Assim como vos agradaram os méritos das vossas virgens, seja de vosso agrado o nosso culto. Por Cristo, nosso Senhor."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "en-US": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "As we proclaim your wonders, O Lord, in the commemoration of the holy Virgins ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        " and ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        ", we bring you these offerings and prayers; grant, we ask, that, as their merits are pleasing to you, so, too, our dutiful service may find favor in your sight."
       ],
       [
        "Through Christ our Lord."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "es": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Señor, te proclamamos admirable"
       ],
       [
        "al conmemorar a las santas vírgenes ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        " y ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        ","
       ],
       [
        "en cuyo honor presentamos estos dones,"
       ],
       [
        "y te rogamos que, así como te agradaron sus méritos,"
       ],
       [
        "aceptes de igual modo nuestro humilde servicio."
       ],
       [
        "Por Jesucristo, nuestro Señor."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "it": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Ti presentiamo, o Signore, le nostre offerte, proclamando le tue meraviglie nella memoria delle sante ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N. "
        },
        "e ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N. "
        },
        ", come ti fu gradita la loro testimonianza verginale, ti sia ben accetta l'offerta del nostro sacrificio. Per Cristo nostro Signore.."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "fr": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Nous proclamons tes merveilles, Seigneur,"
       ],
       [
        "en la mémoire des vierges saintes ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        " et ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        ","
       ],
       [
        "et nous te présentons nos offrandes :"
       ],
       [
        "tu as reconnu les mérites de leur vie,"
       ],
       [
        "accepte, nous t'en prions, l'hommage de ceux qui te servent."
       ],
       [
        "Par le Christ, notre Seigneur."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ],
    "de": [
     {
      "k": "p",
      "lines": [
       [
        "Wir preisen dich, Herr, denn du bist groß in deinen Heiligen. Das Leben der Heiligen ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        " und ",
        {
         "m": "rubric",
         "t": "N."
        },
        " hat dir wohlgefallen; nimm mit diesen Gaben auch unseren Dienst an. Darum bitten wir durch Christus, unseren Herrn."
       ]
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "part": "prayerOverOfferings"
  },
